Andrew Schofield resolved KAFKA-18433.
--------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Adjust ShareFetchRequest RPC to optimise fetching and acknowledgement
> ---------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-18433
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18433
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>            Reporter: Andrew Schofield
>            Assignee: Andrew Schofield
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.1.0
>
>
> Change the RPC request to better align the consumer and broker processing for fetching and acknowledgement. Specifically:
> * Remove PartitionMaxBytes because for share fetching the broker has responsibility for which partitions are fetched as opposed to the consumer
> * Add BatchSize which gives the optimal number of records for batches of acquired records and acknowledgements.
> There will likely be a future round of optimisation to follow.



