> thought
> > that this is fine most of the time as outside clients shouldn't have
> > anything to do with a topic in a VC and therefore it isn't a problem fo=
r
> > them. For admins there is the describeVirtualCluster admin API that wou=
ld
> > reveal these associations if they're needed for debug reasons. If you
> think
> > we should still have VC information in topic-describe, then I'm open to
> it,
> > however as I said, this kind of hurts the transparency of virtual
