hi PoAn

thanks for this kip. A couple of questions are listed below.

chia_0:=20

Should `listConfigs` be renamed to `listConfigResources` to match the returne=
d type?

chia_1:

v0 returns only the ClientMetricsResource, right? If so, could you please add=
 docs to the protocol file and KIP

chia_2:

Should we rollback to use v0 when the request fails due to version match? I p=
oint that because users are suggested to use new method instead of listClient=
MetricsResources, and hence they may encounter version error if not all nodes=
 are up-to-date.

chia_3:

`ListClientMetricsResourcesRequest` and `ListClientMetricsResourcesResponse` =
are not public APIs, so it seems to me it is unnecessary to "deprecate" them

chia_4:

could you please add "empty means all sources are returned" to ListConfigReso=
urcesRequest.json?

Best,
Chia-Ping


