t all kinds of configuration.
> > It=E2=80=99s better to have a API to list all types of configuration. I c=
hange ListClientMetricsResources to ListConfigResources
> > and remove change for ListGroups. For backward compatibility, we also nee=
d to make sure v0 ListConfigResources
> > can work as ListClientMetricsResources.
> >=20
> > AS3: Without change for ListGroupsResponse, we don=E2=80=99t need to hand=
le state and type fields in this KIP.
