>>>>> Hi all,
>>>>>=20
>>>>> I would like to start a discussion thread on KIP-1142.
>>>>>=20
>>>>> Currently, kafka-configs.sh requires explicit group names to =
describe configurations, which limits flexibility in managing =
dynamically configured groups. This KIP proposes extending the =
ListGroups API to include groups that do not exist in the coordinator =
but have dynamic configurations.
>>>>>=20
>>>>> Please take a look and feel free to share any thoughts.
>>>>>=20
>>>>> =
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1142%3A+Allow+to+lis=
