Thanks David.

On Thu, Mar 27, 2025 at 9:50=E2=80=AFAM David Arthur <mumrah@gmail.com> wro=
te:
> Commented-by: left any comment on the PR (any contributor)
> Reviewed-by: did a full review on the PR (any contributor)
> Approved-by: committer(s) who approved the PR

This matches my understanding and captures contributors' intent really well=
.

Approved-by are all of the contributors with write access to the repo
that want the changes merged and included to Apache Kafka.
Reviewed-by are all of the contributors without write access to the
repo that want the changes merged to Apache Kafka.
Commented-by are all of the contributors that participated in the PR
discussion but didn't officially approve that the changes should be
included in the repository.

Thanks!
