usly not=20
> part of ISR=E2=80=94as the new leader), we observe the following in KR=
aft:
>
>   *   An "UNCLEAN partition change" event is logged, despite having=20
> unclean.leader.election.enable explicitly set to false on all brokers=20
> and controllers.
>   *   The metric=20
> kafka.controller:type=3DControllerStats,name=3DUncleanLeaderElectionsP=
erSec=20
> increments continuously and does not reset to 0.
> Relevant logs:
> DEBUG [QuorumController id=3D3] Node 6 has altered ISR for foo-0 to [5=
,=20
> 4]. (org.apache.kafka.controller.ReplicationControlManager)
> INFO [QuorumController id=3D3] AlterPartition request from node 6 for=20
> foo-0 completed the ongoing partition reassignment and triggered a=20
> leadership change. Returning NEW_LEADER_ELECTED.=20
> (org.apache.kafka.controller.ReplicationControlManager)
> INFO [QuorumController id=3D3] UNCLEAN partition change for foo-0 with=20
> topic ID 0nBbSaN0QWy_hmOnfNLNrg: replicas: [4, 5, 6] -> [4, 5],=20
> directories: [fwoolkW969wV61_D5mIIkg, TFl5RsmVwdUxDjTwUb202A,=20
> Osd62auxOyraCSUnTJXWTw] -> [fwoolkW969wV61_D5mIIkg,=20
> TFl5RsmVwdUxDjTwUb202A], isr: [6, 5] -> [5, 4], removingReplicas: [6]=20
> -> [], addingReplicas: [4] -> [], leader: 6 -> 4, leaderEpoch: 1 -> 2,=20
> partitionEpoch: 3 -> 4=20
> (org.apache.kafka.controller.ReplicationControlManager)
> INFO [QuorumController id=3D3] Replayed partition assignment change=20
> PartitionChangeRecord(partitionId=3D0, topicId=3D0nBbSaN0QWy_hmOnfNLNr=
g,=20
> isr=3D[5, 4], leader=3D4, replicas=3D[4, 5], removingReplicas=3D[],=20
> addingReplicas=3D[], leaderRecoveryState=3D-1,=20
> directories=3D[fwoolkW969wV61_D5mIIkg, TFl5RsmVwdUxDjTwUb202A],=20
