Lucas Brutschy created KAFKA-19118:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Enable KIP-1071 in existing streams integration tests
                 Key: KAFKA-19118
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19118
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Lucas Brutschy


We should enable KIP-1071 in integration tests to gain more confidence that=
 a broad range of functionality is supported. We should not enable them in =
every integration test for now, but in a well selected subset.
 * Some may not be supported by 4.1.=C2=A0

 * Some may be blocked by known bugs. Comment on the ticket.

 * Some may not run due to new bugs. Create tickets for them.

 * Some may pass on current trunk. Enable them on trunk.

 * Some may pass on current trunk but do not test interesting functionality=
. We will ignore those for now.

=C2=A0



--
