David Jacot created KAFKA-19120:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Consider whether we could subscribe using topic ids instead of names
                 Key: KAFKA-19120
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19120
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: David Jacot
            Assignee: David Jacot


In the ConsumerGroupHeartbeat API, the consumer passes the subscribe topic names and the subscribed regular expression. We should consider whether we could replace the former by topic ids instead of names. They are pros and cons to both approaches. We should start by defining them.



