Mickael Maison created KAFKA-19149:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Use KIP-877 in MirrorMaker
                 Key: KAFKA-19149
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19149
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: mirrormaker
            Reporter: Mickael Maison


Both the source and checkpoints connectors expose metrics. Now that we have KIP-877, they should use that mechanism instead of custom logic.

This work requires a KIP as names of metrics exposed via KIP-877 will not match the current names. The KIP should introduce a mechanism to optionally use KIP-877, and plan to deprecate and finally remove the current metrics in a future Kafka release.



--
