Mickael Maison created KAFKA-19150:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Consider renaming org.apache.kafka.storage.internals.log.RemoteStorageThreadPool metrics
                 Key: KAFKA-19150
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19150
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Mickael Maison


All metrics use the "kafka.<COMPONENT>" format apart from org.apache.kafka.storage.internals.log:type=RemoteStorageThreadPool where we used the "org.apache.kafka.<COMPONENT>" format.

We should update this metric name so it's consistent with the there ones. Since metrics are part of the public API, this will require a KIP.



