             Summary: Topology description sent to broker contains non-determinstically ordered topic configs
                 Key: KAFKA-19162
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19162
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Lucas Brutschy


Topology description sent to broker in KIP-1071 contains non-determinstically ordered topic configs.

Since the topology is compared to the groups topology upon joining, it should be completely determinstic.

We may run into `INVALID_REQUEST: Topology updates are not supported yet` failures if the topology sent by the application does not match the group topology.



--
