>>>> > > formats and platforms have moved beyond this limitation:
>>>> > >
>>>> > > -
>>>> > >
>>>> > > Formats such as *Avro*, *Parquet*, and *ORC* support microsecond
>>>> (and
>>>> > > even nanosecond) precision. For example, Avro specifies support fo=
r
