Please reopen the ticket if you still face this issue.=C2=A0

> Potential race condition in remote-log-reader and remote-log-index-cleane=
r thread
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------=
--------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19014
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19014
>             Project: Kafka
