Alieh Saeedi created KAFKA-19185:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Logging Enhancements in the FETCH requests and their correlation IDs
                 Key: KAFKA-19185
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19185
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Alieh Saeedi


We need to gather more logs, particularly focusing on the {{FETCH}} requests and their correlation IDs, to better understand the requests involved in the mismatch.

The logging enhancements suggested include: 1. Logging when a {{FETCH}} request is generated, including the correlation ID. 2. Logging the response received before any processing to track any unexpected behaviour.



--
