Hi Manikumar,

You mentioned using Keycloak for integration tests. Everything I'm seein=
g online suggests that this is best done via Testcontainers. I don't see=
 usage of that anywhere in the project thus far. Would adding a test dep=
endency on Testcontainers be within the scope of this KIP, or should it =
have its own KIP?

Thanks,
Kirk

