Hi all,

I created a KIP to improve the latency for high-watermark replication.
A few users have observed that their admin operations can take up
500ms before they are reflected in other parts of the system. This KIP
is my attempt to resolve that issue:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/uIkEFQ

Thanks and please let me know what you think,
--=20
