Andrew Schofield created KAFKA-19189:
----------------------------------------

             Summary: Handle deletion of __share_group_state topic in share coordinator
                 Key: KAFKA-19189
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19189
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Andrew Schofield
            Assignee: Sushant Mahajan


While deletion of the __share_group_state topic is a very unfortunate thing from the point of view of the share coordinator, it remains a possible action. By handling a NOT_LEADER_OR_FOLLOWER error code, it should be possible to reinitialize and avoid endlessly generating exceptions from the periodic processing.



