Lucas Brutschy resolved KAFKA-19118.
------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Enable KIP-1071 in existing streams integration tests
> -----------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19118
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19118
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>          Components: streams, unit tests
>            Reporter: Lucas Brutschy
>            Assignee: Lucas Brutschy
>            Priority: Major
>
> We should enable KIP-1071 in integration tests to gain more confidence th=
at a broad range of functionality is supported. We should not enable them i=
n every integration test for now, but in a well selected subset.
>  * Some may not be supported by 4.1.=C2=A0
>  * Some may be blocked by known bugs. Comment on the ticket.
>  * Some may not run due to new bugs. Create tickets for them.
>  * Some may pass on current trunk. Enable them on trunk.
>  * Some may pass on current trunk but do not test interesting functionali=
ty. We will ignore those for now.
> =C2=A0



