Colin McCabe created KAFKA-19192:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Old bootstrap.metadata files cause problems with post-KAFKA-18601 servers
                 Key: KAFKA-19192
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19192
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
    Affects Versions: 4.1, 4.0.0
            Reporter: Colin McCabe
            Assignee: Colin McCabe


Old bootstrap.metadata files cause problems with post-KAFKA-18601 servers. When the server tries to read the bootstrap.metadata file, it will fail if the metadata.version is older than 3.3-IV3 (feature level 7). This causes problems when these clusters are upgraded.



