PoAn Yang created KAFKA-19197:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Automatic generate metric list in document
                 Key: KAFKA-19197
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19197
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: docs
            Reporter: PoAn Yang
            Assignee: PoAn Yang


Some metrics are automatically generated by gradle tasks like producer sender metrics [0] and consumer fetcher metrics [1]. However, most of metrics are maintained manually in ops.html [2]. It's better to use Metrics#toHtmlTable [3] to generate all metric list.


[0] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/f0f5571dbb08ef7983f64e428fed5b418f398c55/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/producer/internals/ProducerMetrics.java#L36-L38
[1] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/f0f5571dbb08ef7983f64e428fed5b418f398c55/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/ConsumerMetrics.java#L39-L41
[2] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/f0f5571dbb08ef7983f64e428fed5b418f398c55/docs/ops.html#L1381-L3883
[3] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/f0f5571dbb08ef7983f64e428fed5b418f398c55/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/common/metrics/Metrics.java#L247-L257



