>
> Old bootstrap.metadata files cause problems with post-KAFKA-18601 servers=
. When the server tries to read the bootstrap.metadata file, it will fail i=
f the metadata.version is older than 3.3-IV3 (feature level 7). This causes=
 problems when these clusters are upgraded.



