=E2=80=99s
a bit confusing, since all the configs mention =E2=80=9Cit's advisable, but=
 not
required, to have a mechanism=E2=80=A6=E2=80=9D, but I get (from the Reject=
ed Alternatives
actually) that we do support live rotation (with a =E2=80=9Cless dynamic me=
chanism
to detect file changes=E2=80=9D). Should we clarify it in the related *.fil=
e
configs, that it does support live rotation?

Thanks!

