Hi Krik,

Thanks for the updates.

> Would adding a test dependency on Testcontainers be within the scope of
this KIP, or should it have its own KIP?
I don't think we need a separate KIP for this. We can include it as part of
implementing the integration tests.

> Also, Keycloak is MIT licensed. Is that OK to include in Kafka?
Yes, we can use an MIT-licensed library. We just need to include the MIT
license text for the library in the licenses folder.


Thanks.
~
