hi all,

It seems the consensus is to create CloseOptions for streams, and currently
it is almost identical to the CloseOptions for consumers.

I'm +1 to this idea, as streams may have different behavior in the future.
Additionally, I want to raise a question that might highlight a difference
even now :)

chia_0:

Does the CloseOptions for streams need a DEFAULT option if we want to use
an enum? The use case for streams is whether to remove static members or
not, and therefore it seems we can simplify the enum with only LEAVE_GROUP
and REMAIN_IN_GROUP.

Best,
Chia-Ping


