chia_01:
Regarding "partition(TopicPartition topicPartition)", it should return an Opt=
ional<PartitionMetadata>. For the others, we should either return an empty ma=
p (e.g., partitionsForTopic(String topic)) or an empty list (e.g., offlineRep=
licas(PartitionMetadata)).

I'll update the Javadoc as well =E2=80=94 thanks for the reminder!

chia_02:
In TopicImage, there is a similar method, Map<Integer, PartitionRegistration>=
 partitions(), but we can't directly reuse its return value here. As you ment=
ioned, we'll still need to iterate through all partitions to build the collec=
tion. That said, since this KIP proposes to make PartitionRegistration implem=
ents PartitionInfo, the cost of generating the collection should be low.

Thank you!

Best,
Kuan-Po Tseng

