Hi all!

I've published an update KIP, which includes:

1. Clarity and corrections for all of the feedback
2. Use of the mock-oauth2-server library for integration testing
3. Reduced the public exposure of some of the internals (assertion creat=
ion, file caching, etc.)

I'd like to call a vote soon, so if you have additional feedback, please=
 let me know.

Thank you for your feedback and help!

Kirk

