Kirk True created KAFKA-19214:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Clean up use of Optionals in RequestManagers.entries(=
)
                 Key: KAFKA-19214
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19214
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: clients, consumer
    Affects Versions: 4.0.0
            Reporter: Kirk True
            Assignee: Kirk True


The use of {{Optional}} as a wrapper for the individual {{RequestManager}} =
instances in {{RequestManagers}}=C2=A0makes sense, but there's little need =
to for the {{entries()}} API to include {{{}Optional{}}}.

The idea here is to build up a {{List<RequestManager>}} that contains only =
the non-null entries and return that directly. This will cut down on a bit =
of clutter and awkwardness for users of the API.



--
