Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-19220:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: add tests to ensure the internal configs don't return by public APIs by default
                 Key: KAFKA-19220
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19220
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


{code:scala}
  def allConfigs(config: AbstractConfig): mutable.Map[String, Any] = {
    config.originals.asScala.filter(_._2 != null) ++ config.nonInternalValues.asScala
  }
{code}

Internal configurations are used for testing purposes and therefore should not be exposed by default. They should only be returned by public APIs if users explicitly define them.



